sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Editor as Editor widget
    participant DP as DefinitionProvider
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant Lang as adoc_lang
    participant WV as Workspace view
    User->>Editor: Ctrl/Cmd-click an xref
    Editor->>DP: Request definition
    DP->>Eng: Engine::definition
    Eng->>Lang: definition_at_offset (Antora resolver)
    Lang-->>Eng: Target location
    Eng-->>DP: Target
    DP-->>Editor: Link highlighted
    alt Page or section target
        User->>Eng: Click: navigate.follow_link
        Eng->>Eng: Open target, push back-history, set active
        Eng-->>WV: NavigationChanged event
        WV->>WV: Open or activate tab
        WV->>Editor: Place caret at target
    else Image target
        Eng-->>WV: Opens in an image tab
    else PDF inside a workspace folder
        Eng-->>WV: External, opens in the system viewer
    else Any other file
        Eng-->>WV: Opens as text, or is refused
    end
